-**Data Structures**
-The core data structure is the Gaussian primitive, extended with temporal attributes.
-*   **3D Attributes:** `means3D` (3D position), `scales` (3D scale), `rotations` (4D quaternion), `opacity` (scalar), `sh` (Spherical Harmonics coefficients) [S1, unofficial].
-*   **4D Attributes:** `scales_t` (temporal scale modulation), `ts` (temporal position/phase), `rotations_r` (4D rotation components), `marginal_t` (marginal time probability) [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Rasterization Settings:** `GaussianRasterizationSettings` struct containing `image_height`, `image_width`, `tanfovx`, `tanfovy`, `bg`, `scale_modifier`, `viewmatrix`, `projmatrix`, `sh_degree`, `sh_degree_t`, `campos`, `timestamp`, `time_duration`, `rot_4d`, `gaussian_dim`, `force_sh_3d` [S1, unofficial].
+**Outputs:**
+- Dictionary containing:
+  - `rendered_image`: Tensor `(C, H, W)`.
+  - `viewspace_points`: Tensor of 2D screen-space means with gradients.
+  - `visibility_filter`: Boolean tensor.
+  - `radii_all`: Tensor of radii.
+  - `depth`: Tensor of depths.
+  - `alpha`: Tensor of alpha values.
+  - `flow`: Tensor of flow vectors.
 
